CodeSystem: HIVTBWorkbookConcepts
Id: hiv-tb-workbook-concepts
Title: "Ethiopia HIV/TB workbook concepts"
Description: "HIV/TB concepts from the October 2026 workbook whose identifiers also occur with different meanings in the Care and Treatment worksheet."
* ^status = #draft
* ^experimental = true
* ^caseSensitive = true
* ^content = #complete

* #HIV.D.ET.DE3 "Treatment after failure" "Returning for a new course after documented TB treatment failure."
* #HIV.D.ET.DE4 "Treatment after loss to follow-up" "Returning for TB care after interrupting and not completing the previous course."
* #HIV.D.ET.DE5 "Transfer in" "Transferred from another facility or treatment unit to continue TB treatment."
* #HIV.D.ET.DE6 "Other" "A documented TB treatment history not covered by another choice."
* #HIV.D.ET.DE7 "Screening with LF-LAM" "TB screening using a urine LF-LAM test, as documented by the service."
